─────     │     │\n──────┌───────┐───────└──────────────────────────\n──────│───────│───────││───────           │   ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n──────│───────│───────││──────────────────│───│──                           │\n      └───────┘       ││──────            │   │ │// src/animation.ts        │\n──────────────────────│───────────────────────│──begin():                   │\n                      └───────────────────┘   │ │  start = mobject.copy()   │\n───────────────────────┘──────────────────────│──each frame:                │\n                       │                      │ │  blend(start, end,        │\n──────────────────────┌───────────────────┐───│──                           │\n                      │    ───────────    │   │ │    rateFunc(t / runTime)) │\n──────┌───────┐───────│────────────────────   │ │                           │\n──────│───────│───────└───────────────────────│──// the nudge, each frame:  │\n      └───────┘       │ ───────────────   │   │ │  dot.shift(step)          │\n──────────────────────└───────────────────┘───│──                           │\n                    ┌────────────────────────┐└─────────────────────────────┘\n───────────────────endpoints fixed at begin()│───\n────────────────────└────────────────────────┘──┘\n"},{"step":"check","title":"Seeked frame by frame: 45 of 45 match with blending, 16 with the nudge","line":"rayner check fails a page on the first seeked frame that differs from playback.","caption":"The strips compare all 45 frames of this tiny scene with independently seeked stills. Blending agrees throughout; the nudge first differs at frame 17. rayner check samples less: in every step of every case it seeks one frame midway and one just before the step ends. A mismatch fails the check, but agreement at those two times does not prove every possible time. An updater follows a different path: in a scene with updaters, a still computes every frame before t.","start":114.067,"end":144.467,"hold":115.767,"state":{"